 "schema_notes": {
  "grow": "optional {from_w, to_w, ms} (px at this res): the engine draws the effect stretched horizontally from from_w to to_w over its first ms after spawn, the anchored end fixed, so a beam extends from the hands instead of appearing whole; null = draw the frames as authored.",
  "flash": "bool: frame 0 is a one-frame release flash (white-hot); the engine may whiten the owner sprite / flash the scene for that frame's ms.  Never true on a looping effect.",
